    // DRAM backing: weights, embeddings, overflow activations
```
核心原则：(1) Activation buffer在model execution全程复用，LLS避免因capacity pressure被evict导致的DRAM writeback delay；(2) Weights为constant，LLC eviction无需writeback；(3) 该策略对推荐模型特别有效——dense network达到>95% SRAM hit rate，sparse network 40-60%。当activations无法完全fit LLS时，可leverage memory hints (hardware-supported) skip write-back to DRAM。

